gh...”\\nThat’s what it says.\\rI went to a dark cave the other day\\nwith a friend.\\rThat cave leads to another route.\\nBy the way, I must thank you for\\fbeing so kind.\\rI’d like to do something good in return.\\r","msg_0378_R31_00008":"TM44 is...\\n...Zzz...\\f...\\r...Umm... Rest!\\rThe phrase “recover fast” became\\nshortened to “Rest,” you see?\\fThis is a move to sleep and recover HP.","msg_0378_R31_00009":"...I’m\\nsleepy...","msg_0378_R31_00010":"...Wait!\\nThat would make you not have\\fany Pokémon!","msg_0378_R31_00011":"I found a good Pokémon in Dark Cave.\\nI’m going to raise it to take on\\fFalkner.\\rHe’s the leader of Violet City’s Gym.","msg_0378_R31_00012":"Dark Cave...\\rIf a Pokémon could light it up,\\nI’d explore it.","msg_0378_R31_00013":"Rt. 31\\nWest to Violet City","msg_0378_R31_00014":"Dark Cave","msg_0378_R31_00015":"Huh? What is it?\\nIs that a Pokémon Egg?\\fI’ve never seen one.\\r...Zzz..."},"initTriggers":[],"initScripts":{},"constants":{"_EV_scr_seq_R31_000":0,"_EV_scr_seq_R31_001":1,"_EV_scr_seq_R31_002":2,"_EV_scr_seq_R31_003":3,"_EV_scr_seq_R31_004":4,"_EV_scr_seq_R31_005":5,"obj_R31_gsman1":0,"obj_R31_tree":1,"obj_R31_gsbigman":2,"obj_R31_tree_2":3,"obj_R31_gsboy1":4,"obj_R31_gsboy3":5,"obj_R31_monstarball":6,"obj_R31_monstarball_2":7,"obj_R31_bonguri":8}}
